# Publish-only scope override: this machine's default registry is the
# npmmirror mirror (read-only for publishing). Publishing @tangzai/* must go
# to the official registry — scoped to this package only, so dependency
# installs keep using the mirror. The official-registry auth token lives in
# the user-level ~/.npmrc (//registry.npmjs.org/:_authToken=...).
@tangzai:registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
